**Blue/Green Deployment Verification**:
1. Deploy to staging with feature flag checks
2. Verify traffic switch after validation
3. Execute rollback procedure
4. Verify green deployment restoration

**Documentation Verification**:
1. Follow release runbook for test deployment
2. Verify all commands execute successfully
3. Verify rollback procedures work as documented

